= Notes

== AI observation

The results presented here were produced primarily by AI and verified by me.

* **[files/SKmodelATline.pdf Fast Mixing of Glauber Dynamics in the SK Model up to the AT Scale]**  *
  *Abstract.* This note improves the $(\beta,h)$ fast-mixing boundary for Glauber dynamics in the SK model established by [https://arxiv.org/pdf/2607.06813 Bandeira A S, Alaoui A E, and Rödder A], from $h\sim \beta^2\sqrt{\log \beta}$ to the AT-scale $h\sim \beta\sqrt{\log \beta}$.


